    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a content strategist. Based on this video data, provide exactly 4 outputs separated by \"|||\":\n\n1. A 3-4 sentence summary of what the video is about\n2. A ready-to-use comment that can be posted on this video (engaging, authentic, adds value)\n3. A reshare/repost caption for sharing this content on social media (compelling, includes context)\n4. An original content draft inspired by the same idea (brief outline or concept)\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n- Output ONLY plain text, no Markdown formatting\n- Use exactly \"|||\" (three pipe characters) to separate each section\n- Keep each section concise and actionable\n- Do not include section numbers or labels in the output\n\nVideo Data:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nChannel: {{ $json.channelName }}\nViews: {{ $json.viewCount }}\nDescription: {{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "32f21707-6700-41ce-9689-e5c83a1b0fee",
      "name": "AI Content Analyzer",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        1136,
        -704
      ]
